    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to talk to people about it. they all say the same thing, \"it gets better\" or \"hang in there,\" and it just feels like they aren't actually listening. it's like they're just trying to fix me so they don't have to deal with how heavy it is. i feel like i've been fighting for so long and i've nothing left to give. there's just no point in trying to \"get better\" when everything feels so empty anyway.",
